# G8 (graphics): the caret in a dialog's text field. A click puts the caret between two characters and the keys edit there (Delete,
# Backspace, Left, Right, Home, End), a drag selects and typing replaces the selection, a double click selects a word; the same in
# the file name prompt. Every frame's CRC-32 must equal the host's.
@prompt
@copy letter.rtf
@open LETTER.RTF
@click 145 9            # Find menu
@click 215 32           # Find...
@click 336 204          # the field
q u i c k space b r o w n space f o x
@click 232 204          # the caret between two letters
delete delete
left left bspace
home x
end y
@drag 218 204 268 204   # a selection
z                       # typing replaces it
@dclick 236 204         # a word selected
@click 336 292          # Close is out of the way: the dialog stays
@click 2 2
esc
f10 enter               # File > Open: the file name prompt
l e t t e r period r t f
@click 296 226          # the caret in the name
left left x
@drag 220 226 300 226
delete
esc
f10 end enter
